Hello, I'm KaFai, a self-taught programmer from HK. I have worked in different startups before(most recently in [River](https://river.com)).
I plan to document my learning journey and hopefully it will benefits others as well.

I also believe in [small web](https://kagi.com/smallweb) and open-protocols like
RSS and [Nostr](https://nostr.com/).

This website is built with [Zine](https://zine-ssg.io/), a new static site generator in Zig.
